<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Roblox auto FULL WALLBOOST</Major>
    <Description>Hello! I made this script to make one of the hardest mechaniques on Parkour very easy to do!

How to use: Simply wall to a building, hold W then activate the macro, at the end of the fullboost, just stop holding W and press space! Every wallboost / wallrun is about 60-40ms so it's not too blatant and won't trigger anticheat!

Screen resolution: 1920x1080

Enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
